### 2. 🔐 Authorization: 1 Policy for 150 Models = Unauthorized CRUD possible by any logged-in teacher/student role
Enterprise standard: 1 Policy per Model, covering viewAny/view/create/update/delete/forceDelete/restore (Fedena: 82 policies, PowerSchool: 140 policies).
NepalSchoolHub: Only QuestionPaperPolicy.php .

The entire authorization layer relies exclusively on Gate::before() wildcard for super-admin + role middleware :

🔴 Production security risk. Fix: 62 Policies minimum (one per public-facing model) with tenant+ownership tests — AuthServiceProvider needs a $policies = [Student::class => StudentPolicy::class, ...] map.

