### 5. 🏷️ Admissions Workflow — No Evaluation/Entrance Exam / Document Verification State Machine
Enterprise (Fedena Alma): Submitted → Docs Verified → Entrance Exam → Interview → Merit List Published → Admitted → Fee Paid → Class Assigned → Roll No. NepalSchoolHub: AdmissionApplication model exists but the controller flow is CREATE → direct decision , no states.

🔴 Risk: Schools cannot legally admit students without documented document-verification steps per Education Regulation 2059 §16(2).

